OL,3,CTV-related anniversaries for 16 OCT
OL,4,CCHANNELS
OL,5,
OL,6,CG1987FIn the early hours of the
OL,7,Fmorning, a major storm hit the south of
OL,8,FEngland. BBC Television Centre lost its
OL,9,Fmain power supply. Via a back-up
OL,10,Fgenerator NC1 (Network Control for BBC
OL,11,FOne) kept BBC One on air, with an
OL,12,Fimpromptu edition of BBC Breakfast
OL,13,FTime, presented by Nicholas Witchell
OL,14,Ffrom the BBC One continuity studio (NC1
OL,15,FCon), also known as The Broom Cupboard
OL,16,Fby viewers of CBBC. The programme later
OL,17,Fswitched to a temporary studio.
OL,18,
OL,19,FTV-am was initially broadcast from a
OL,20,Fsmall studio at Thames TV before power
OL,21,Fwas restored at its main studios in
OL,22,FCamden.
OL,23,Sppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBOn This DayCClean FeedFNat TV
