OL,3,CTV-related anniversaries for 16 OCT
OL,4,CCHANNELS
OL,5,
OL,6,CG1991FFollowing changes to the system
OL,7,Fof ITV licence allocation laid out in
OL,8,FThe Broadcasting Act 1990, the
OL,9,FIndependent Television Commission today
OL,10,Fannounced the results of the franchise
OL,11,Fround, for licences beginning 1st
OL,12,FJanuary 1993.
OL,13,
OL,14,F- Thames - the biggest programme
OL,15,Fsupplier to the ITV network - was
OL,16,Foutbid by broadcasting and media
OL,17,Fservices company, Carlton Television.
OL,18,F- TV-am was outbid by #20m by Sunrise
OL,19,FTV.
OL,20,F- TVS failed to renew its licence
OL,21,Fbecause it bid too much - Meridian
OL,22,FBroadcasting won that franchise.
OL,23,Sppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
